OL,3,ACovid inquiry report: key findings on
OL,4,Atesting, tracing and 'the pingdemic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarly efforts to contain coronavirus
OL,7,F"were doomed to fail" because the test,
OL,8,Ftrace and isolate system in the UK
OL,9,Fcould only handle a relatively small
OL,10,Fnumber of cases, the seventh report of
OL,11,Fthe Covid inquiry says in a damning
OL,12,Fassessment.
OL,14,FAcross 245 pages the inquiry looks at
OL,15,Feverything from border controls to how
OL,16,Fwell contact tracing worked.
OL,18,FHere's what you need to know.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
