OL,3,ACovid inquiry report: key findings on
OL,4,Atesting, tracing and 'the pingdemic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report said the virus was allowed
OL,7,Fto spread virtually unchecked in the
OL,8,Ffirst few months after community
OL,9,Ftesting and contact tracing was
OL,10,Fabandoned in mid-March 2020, costing
OL,11,Flives.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
