OL,3,ATimetable set out for dismantling
OL,4,Aleasehold system in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has set out a timetable
OL,7,Ffor when the leasehold system in
OL,8,FEngland and Wales will be dismantled.
OL,10,FUnder the plans, most new flats - with
OL,11,Fonly limited exemptions - will be sold
OL,12,Fas commonhold, where residents
OL,13,Fcollectively own and manage their
OL,14,Fbuildings.
OL,16,FThe government says a modernised
OL,17,Fcommonhold model is expected to be up
OL,18,Fand running around 2029, followed by a
OL,19,Fban on the sale of most new leasehold
OL,20,Fflats, expected around 2031.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
