OL,3,ATimetable set out for dismantling
OL,4,Aleasehold system in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, a #250 cap on ground rents -
OL,7,Fthe annual fee paid by leaseholders to
OL,8,Ftheir freeholder - is expected to come
OL,9,Finto force in 2028, six months after a
OL,10,Fnew law passes.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
