OL,3,AMyanmar committed genocide against
OL,4,ARohingya minority, top UN court rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FMyanmar has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fcommitting genocide against its
OL,8,FRohingya minority by the International
OL,9,FCourt of Justice (ICJ).
OL,11,FThe verdict marks the first time a
OL,12,Fstate has ever been found to have
OL,13,Fcommitted genocide by an international
OL,14,Fcourt.
OL,16,FYuji Iwasawa, president of the UN's top
OL,17,Fcourt, said Myanmar had the "intention
OL,18,Fto destroy" a substantial part of the
OL,19,FRohingya population and engaged in
OL,20,F"extensive destruction of evidence" to
OL,21,Fhide its crimes.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
