OL,3,AEurope ready for talks with Russia on
OL,4,Aending war in Ukraine, leaders say
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump's son-in-law Jared
OL,7,FKushner, one of the two US envoys who
OL,8,Fwere in Berlin, said the US president
OL,9,Fwanted to make a deal with Moscow "with
OL,10,FEurope by his side". Russia's Vladimir
OL,11,FPutin has so far rejected any European
OL,12,Frole in the US-led peace talks.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
